# Testing Patterns and Strategies

## Overview
The timesheet microservice follows comprehensive testing strategies with unit tests, integration tests, and test utilities. Testing ensures code quality, reliability, and maintainability across all layers of the application.

## Test Structure

### 1. Test Package Organization
```
src/test/java/io/recruitcrm/microservice/timesheet/
├── controllers/
│   ├── timesheet/
│   │   ├── TimesheetControllerTests.java
│   │   └── ITimesheetControllerTests.java
│   └── access_control/
│       └── AccessControlTestControllerTests.java
├── services/
│   ├── timesheet/
│   │   ├── TimesheetServiceTests.java
│   │   └── ITimesheetServiceTests.java
│   └── rule_engine/
│       └── RuleEngineServiceTests.java
├── repositories/
│   ├── timesheet/
│   │   ├── TimesheetRepositoryTests.java
│   │   └── TimesheetDaoTests.java
│   └── time_log/
│       └── TimeLogRepositoryTests.java
└── helpers/
    ├── AuthTests.java
    └── GenericHelperTests.java
```

### 2. Test Class Naming Conventions
- **Unit Tests**: `[Class]Tests` (e.g., `TimesheetServiceTests`)
- **Integration Tests**: `[Class]IntegrationTests` (e.g., `TimesheetControllerIntegrationTests`)
- **Test Interfaces**: `I[Class]Tests` (e.g., `ITimesheetServiceTests`)

## Unit Testing Patterns

### 1. Service Layer Testing
```java
@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)
class TimesheetServiceTests {
    
    @Mock
    private TimesheetRepository timesheetRepository;
    
    @Mock
    private TimesheetMapper timesheetMapper;
    
    @Mock
    private BulkPermissionChecker bulkPermissionChecker;
    
    @Mock
    private Logger logger;
    
    @InjectMocks
    private TimesheetService timesheetService;
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("Create timesheet - Success")
    void testCreateTimesheet_validInput_createsTimesheet() {
        // Arrange
        TimesheetRequestDto request = new TimesheetRequestDto(
            "Weekly Timesheet", 123, 456, LocalDate.now(), List.of());
        
        Timesheet timesheet = new Timesheet();
        timesheet.setId(1);
        timesheet.setName("Weekly Timesheet");
        
        TimesheetResponseDto expectedResponse = new TimesheetResponseDto(
            1, "Weekly Timesheet", 123, 456, "DRAFT", LocalDateTime.now());
        
        when(timesheetMapper.toEntity(request)).thenReturn(timesheet);
        when(timesheetRepository.save(timesheet)).thenReturn(timesheet);
        when(timesheetMapper.toResponseDto(timesheet)).thenReturn(expectedResponse);
        
        // Act
        TimesheetResponseDto result = timesheetService.createTimesheet(request);
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(result).isNotNull();
        assertThat(result.id()).isEqualTo(1);
        assertThat(result.name()).isEqualTo("Weekly Timesheet");
        
        verify(timesheetRepository).save(timesheet);
        verify(logger).logInfo(contains("Creating timesheet"));
    }
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("Create timesheet - Validation error")
    void testCreateTimesheet_invalidInput_throwsValidationError() {
        // Arrange
        TimesheetRequestDto request = new TimesheetRequestDto(
            "", 123, 456, LocalDate.now(), List.of());
        
        when(timesheetRepository.existsByCandidateIdAndJobIdAndDate(
            request.candidateId(), request.jobId(), request.date()))
            .thenReturn(true);
        
        // Act & Assert
        ValidationErrorException exception = assertThrows(ValidationErrorException.class, () ->
            timesheetService.createTimesheet(request));
        
        assertThat(exception.getMessage()).contains("Timesheet already exists");
        verify(timesheetRepository, never()).save(any());
    }
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("Get timesheet by id - Success")
    void testGetTimesheetById_validId_returnsTimesheet() {
        // Arrange
        Integer timesheetId = 1;
        Timesheet timesheet = new Timesheet();
        timesheet.setId(timesheetId);
        timesheet.setName("Test Timesheet");
        
        TimesheetResponseDto expectedResponse = new TimesheetResponseDto(
            timesheetId, "Test Timesheet", 123, 456, "DRAFT", LocalDateTime.now());
        
        when(timesheetRepository.findById(timesheetId)).thenReturn(Optional.of(timesheet));
        when(timesheetMapper.toResponseDto(timesheet)).thenReturn(expectedResponse);
        
        // Mock permission check
        BulkPermissionCheckResult permissionResult = BulkPermissionCheckResult.builder()
            .results(List.of(BulkPermissionCheckResult.BulkPermissionCheckResultItem.builder()
                .allowed(true)
                .build()))
            .build();
        
        when(bulkPermissionChecker.checkBulkPermissions(any())).thenReturn(permissionResult);
        
        // Act
        TimesheetResponseDto result = timesheetService.getTimesheetById(timesheetId);
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(result).isNotNull();
        assertThat(result.id()).isEqualTo(timesheetId);
        verify(bulkPermissionChecker).checkBulkPermissions(any());
    }
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("Get timesheet by id - Not found")
    void testGetTimesheetById_invalidId_throwsResourceNotFoundException() {
        // Arrange
        Integer timesheetId = 999;
        when(timesheetRepository.findById(timesheetId)).thenReturn(Optional.empty());
        
        // Mock permission check
        BulkPermissionCheckResult permissionResult = BulkPermissionCheckResult.builder()
            .results(List.of(BulkPermissionCheckResult.BulkPermissionCheckResultItem.builder()
                .allowed(true)
                .build()))
            .build();
        
        when(bulkPermissionChecker.checkBulkPermissions(any())).thenReturn(permissionResult);
        
        // Act & Assert
        ResourceNotFoundException exception = assertThrows(ResourceNotFoundException.class, () ->
            timesheetService.getTimesheetById(timesheetId));
        
        assertThat(exception.getMessage()).contains("Timesheet not found");
    }
}
```

### 2. Controller Layer Testing
```java
@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)
class TimesheetControllerTests {
    
    @Mock
    private ITimesheetService timesheetService;
    
    @Mock
    private APIResponder apiResponder;
    
    @Mock
    private Logger logger;
    
    @InjectMocks
    private TimesheetController timesheetController;
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("POST /timesheets - Success")
    void testCreateTimesheet_validInput_returns200() {
        // Arrange
        TimesheetRequestDto request = new TimesheetRequestDto(
            "Weekly Timesheet", 123, 456, LocalDate.now(), List.of());
        
        TimesheetResponseDto serviceResponse = new TimesheetResponseDto(
            1, "Weekly Timesheet", 123, 456, "DRAFT", LocalDateTime.now());
        
        ResponseEntity<?> expectedResponse = ResponseEntity.ok()
            .body(new APINormalResponse<>("SUCCESS", "Timesheet created successfully", serviceResponse));
        
        when(timesheetService.createTimesheet(request)).thenReturn(serviceResponse);
        when(apiResponder.respond(serviceResponse, "Timesheet created successfully"))
            .thenReturn(expectedResponse);
        
        // Act
        ResponseEntity<?> result = timesheetController.createTimesheet(request);
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(result.getStatusCode()).isEqualTo(HttpStatus.OK);
        verify(timesheetService).createTimesheet(request);
        verify(logger).logInfo(contains("Creating timesheet"));
    }
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("POST /timesheets - Validation error")
    void testCreateTimesheet_invalidInput_returns400() {
        // Arrange
        TimesheetRequestDto request = new TimesheetRequestDto(
            "", 123, 456, LocalDate.now(), List.of());
        
        ResponseEntity<?> expectedResponse = ResponseEntity.badRequest()
            .body(new APIErrorResponse("ERROR", "Validation failed", "VALIDATION_ERROR"));
        
        when(timesheetService.createTimesheet(request))
            .thenThrow(new ValidationErrorException("Name is required"));
        when(apiResponder.respondWithError("Name is required", HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST))
            .thenReturn(expectedResponse);
        
        // Act
        ResponseEntity<?> result = timesheetController.createTimesheet(request);
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(result.getStatusCode()).isEqualTo(HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST);
        verify(logger).logWarn(contains("Validation error"));
    }
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("GET /timesheets/{id} - Success")
    void testGetTimesheetById_validId_returns200() {
        // Arrange
        Integer timesheetId = 1;
        TimesheetResponseDto serviceResponse = new TimesheetResponseDto(
            timesheetId, "Test Timesheet", 123, 456, "DRAFT", LocalDateTime.now());
        
        ResponseEntity<?> expectedResponse = ResponseEntity.ok()
            .body(new APINormalResponse<>("SUCCESS", "Timesheet retrieved successfully", serviceResponse));
        
        when(timesheetService.getTimesheetById(timesheetId)).thenReturn(serviceResponse);
        when(apiResponder.respond(serviceResponse, "Timesheet retrieved successfully"))
            .thenReturn(expectedResponse);
        
        // Act
        ResponseEntity<?> result = timesheetController.getTimesheetById(timesheetId);
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(result.getStatusCode()).isEqualTo(HttpStatus.OK);
        verify(timesheetService).getTimesheetById(timesheetId);
    }
}
```

### 3. Repository Layer Testing
```java
@DataJpaTest
class TimesheetRepositoryTests {
    
    @Autowired
    private TimesheetRepository timesheetRepository;
    
    @Autowired
    private TestEntityManager entityManager;
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("Find by candidate id - Success")
    void testFindByCandidateId_validCandidateId_returnsTimesheets() {
        // Arrange
        Timesheet timesheet1 = createTestTimesheet("Timesheet 1", 123);
        Timesheet timesheet2 = createTestTimesheet("Timesheet 2", 123);
        Timesheet timesheet3 = createTestTimesheet("Timesheet 3", 456);
        
        entityManager.persistAndFlush(timesheet1);
        entityManager.persistAndFlush(timesheet2);
        entityManager.persistAndFlush(timesheet3);
        
        // Act
        List<Timesheet> result = timesheetRepository.findByCandidateId(123);
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(result).hasSize(2);
        assertThat(result).extracting("candidateId").containsOnly(123);
        assertThat(result).extracting("name").contains("Timesheet 1", "Timesheet 2");
    }
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("Exists by candidate id and job id and date - Success")
    void testExistsByCandidateIdAndJobIdAndDate_validData_returnsTrue() {
        // Arrange
        Timesheet timesheet = createTestTimesheet("Test Timesheet", 123);
        timesheet.setJobId(456);
        timesheet.setDate(LocalDate.of(2024, 1, 15));
        
        entityManager.persistAndFlush(timesheet);
        
        // Act
        boolean exists = timesheetRepository.existsByCandidateIdAndJobIdAndDate(123, 456, LocalDate.of(2024, 1, 15));
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(exists).isTrue();
    }
    
    private Timesheet createTestTimesheet(String name, Integer candidateId) {
        Timesheet timesheet = new Timesheet();
        timesheet.setName(name);
        timesheet.setCandidateId(candidateId);
        timesheet.setJobId(1);
        timesheet.setStatus("DRAFT");
        timesheet.setDate(LocalDate.now());
        timesheet.setAccountId(1);
        return timesheet;
    }
}
```

## Integration Testing

### 1. Controller Integration Tests
```java
@SpringBootTest(webEnvironment = SpringBootTest.WebEnvironment.RANDOM_PORT)
@AutoConfigureTestDatabase(replace = AutoConfigureTestDatabase.Replace.NONE)
@TestPropertySource(properties = {
    "spring.datasource.url=jdbc:h2:mem:testdb",
    "spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=create-drop"
})
class TimesheetControllerIntegrationTests {
    
    @Autowired
    private TestRestTemplate restTemplate;
    
    @Autowired
    private TimesheetRepository timesheetRepository;
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("POST /v1/timesheets - Integration test")
    void testCreateTimesheet_integration() {
        // Arrange
        TimesheetRequestDto request = new TimesheetRequestDto(
            "Integration Test Timesheet", 123, 456, LocalDate.now(), List.of());
        
        HttpHeaders headers = new HttpHeaders();
        headers.setContentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON);
        
        HttpEntity<TimesheetRequestDto> entity = new HttpEntity<>(request, headers);
        
        // Act
        ResponseEntity<APINormalResponse> response = restTemplate.postForEntity(
            "/v1/timesheets", entity, APINormalResponse.class);
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(response.getStatusCode()).isEqualTo(HttpStatus.OK);
        assertThat(response.getBody().getResult()).isEqualTo("SUCCESS");
        
        // Verify database
        List<Timesheet> timesheets = timesheetRepository.findByCandidateId(123);
        assertThat(timesheets).hasSize(1);
        assertThat(timesheets.get(0).getName()).isEqualTo("Integration Test Timesheet");
    }
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("GET /v1/timesheets/{id} - Integration test")
    void testGetTimesheetById_integration() {
        // Arrange
        Timesheet timesheet = createTestTimesheet("Integration Test", 123);
        timesheetRepository.save(timesheet);
        
        // Act
        ResponseEntity<APINormalResponse> response = restTemplate.getForEntity(
            "/v1/timesheets/" + timesheet.getId(), APINormalResponse.class);
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(response.getStatusCode()).isEqualTo(HttpStatus.OK);
        assertThat(response.getBody().getResult()).isEqualTo("SUCCESS");
    }
}
```

### 2. Service Integration Tests
```java
@SpringBootTest
@Transactional
class TimesheetServiceIntegrationTests {
    
    @Autowired
    private TimesheetService timesheetService;
    
    @Autowired
    private TimesheetRepository timesheetRepository;
    
    @Test
    @DisplayName("Create and retrieve timesheet - Integration")
    void testCreateAndRetrieveTimesheet_integration() {
        // Arrange
        TimesheetRequestDto request = new TimesheetRequestDto(
            "Integration Test", 123, 456, LocalDate.now(), List.of());
        
        // Act
        TimesheetResponseDto created = timesheetService.createTimesheet(request);
        TimesheetResponseDto retrieved = timesheetService.getTimesheetById(created.id());
        
        // Assert
        assertThat(created).isNotNull();
        assertThat(created.name()).isEqualTo("Integration Test");
        assertThat(retrieved).isNotNull();
        assertThat(retrieved.id()).isEqualTo(created.id());
        assertThat(retrieved.name()).isEqualTo(created.name());
    }
}
```

## Test Utilities and Helpers

### 1. Test Data Builders
```java
public class TestDataBuilder {
    
    public static TimesheetRequestDto createTimesheetRequest() {
        return new TimesheetRequestDto(
            "Test Timesheet",
            123,
            456,
            LocalDate.now(),
            List.of()
        );
    }
    
    public static TimesheetRequestDto createTimesheetRequest(String name, Integer candidateId, Integer jobId) {
        return new TimesheetRequestDto(
            name,
            candidateId,
            jobId,
            LocalDate.now(),
            List.of()
        );
    }
    
    public static Timesheet createTimesheet() {
        Timesheet timesheet = new Timesheet();
        timesheet.setName("Test Timesheet");
        timesheet.setCandidateId(123);
        timesheet.setJobId(456);
        timesheet.setStatus("DRAFT");
        timesheet.setDate(LocalDate.now());
        timesheet.setAccountId(1);
        return timesheet;
    }
    
    public static TimesheetResponseDto createTimesheetResponse() {
        return new TimesheetResponseDto(
            1,
            "Test Timesheet",
            123,
            456,
            "DRAFT",
            LocalDateTime.now()
        );
    }
    
    public static BulkPermissionCheckRequest createBulkPermissionRequest() {
        return BulkPermissionCheckRequest.builder()
            .items(List.of(BulkPermissionCheckRequest.BulkPermissionCheckItem.builder()
                .entity(Entity.TIMESHEET)
                .permissionCheckContext(PermissionCheckContext.builder()
                    .permission(Permission.VIEW_TIMESHEET)
                    .permissionLevel(PermissionLevel.YES)
                    .build())
                .accessControlCheckMetadataContext(AccessControlCheckMetadataContext.builder()
                    .timesheetId(1)
                    .build())
                .build()))
            .build();
    }
}
```

